<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45855" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔφυδρ-ος</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔπ-</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕδωρ</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>moist, rainy</i>, of the west wind, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				14.458
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡμέρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aristid.
					<u>Or.</u>
					48
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				24
			</span></i>).<i><span class="en">
				50
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>abounding in water</i>, [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆ] ἔπυδρος πίδαξι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					4.198
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i><i>Aër.</i><i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				347a31
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.15
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>living on the water</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νῆτται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>Im.</u>
					1.9
				</span></i>
			 (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίϋδρος</span>).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
